{"projectInfo":{"name":"VRRP负载均衡模式配置举例（交换机）","path":"arrp","visibility":2,"categoryId":6283,"introduction":"Switch A、Switch B和Switch C属于备份组1；备份组1工作在负载均衡模式，通过一个备份组实现负载分担，充分利用网关资源；在Switch A、Switch B和Switch C上分别配置虚拟转发器通过Track项监视上行接口（VLAN接口3）的状态。当上行接口出现故障时，降低Switch A、Switch B或Switch C上虚拟转发器的权重，以便其它设备接管它的转发任务。","label":["VRRP负载均衡"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"Host A","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Host A.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Host B","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Host B.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Host C","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Host C.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWA","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWC","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWB","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"S6850_7","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\S6850_7.cfg"},{"resourceName":"NET","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\NET.cfg"}]}